{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫處境劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》今晚（20日）播出一集，將再惡搞城中話題。</p><p>《東張西望》8月下旬曾報道「霸道總管戀上保安阿姨」個案，引起極大迴響，除因真實情節比劇本更荒謬，更因「東張女神」梁敏巧形容當事人郭總的「鮮艷打扮」，似足安德尊引爆熱話。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.618871+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T04:28:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:37:35.473893+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684322+00:00","content_hash":"7eff614b4481a9eacde90d386afe256836050cc3e28bb2289f39c450109a9417","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}